DTEND:20260509T051500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T033000Z
UID:VSRF5LGLR8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nIn a Sudanese cotton village wher
 e the matriarch is rumored to have killed a British general\, teenage Nafi
 sa must decide what she owes her grandmother’s legacy and what she’s w
 illing to burn down to claim her own.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/cot
 ton-queen\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Film Center (Sat 9 May\, 3:30 PM)\n\n
 Estimated start: 20:40
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
