BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Aanikoobijigan [ancestor/great-grandparent/great-grandchild] (2/2)
DTSTART:20260517T190000Z
DTEND:20260517T204500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T190000Z
UID:EXUo8ElEbw
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nIndigenous elders and activists f
 ighting to reclaim ancestors’ remains\, exposing colonial violence and i
 nstitutional resistance while affirming that returning bodies to the earth
  restores dignity\, memory\, and balance.Director Zack Khalil (Ojibway) sc
 heduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/aanikoobijigan-ancesto
 r/great-grandparent/great-grandchild\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • PACCAR IMA
 X Theater at Pacific Science Center (Sat 16 May\, 4:00 PM)\n\nEstimated st
 art: 12:10
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
